  "body": "Replace the current B-rep engine with Solidcore (booleans, offsets, fillets, healing). Retirement gate: a dual-kernel agreement bench vs truck, the corrupt-input corpus unchanged, the heavy lane, a wasm32 build. STEP IO stays on truck. Unlocks IGES import (currently refused by name), face/island recognition, boolean stock ops.\r\n\r\nDone means: the gate passes and truck's kernel role is retired.\r\n\r\nSource: ROADMAP.md M12.1\r\n",
